{"version":2,"nodes":[{"type":"text","x":40,"y":16,"width":1000,"height":"fit-content","text":"N13 视频通话：两层含义 + 后台逐帧链路（资料少，多为【待核】）","fontSize":16,"textColor":"#111827"},{"type":"rect","id":"N13-01","x":40,"y":80,"width":300,"height":150,"fillColor":"#DBEAFE","borderColor":"#2563eb","borderWidth":2,"borderRadius":8,"text":[{"content":"N13-01 vehicle_communication（TOOL03 车端通讯）\n","bold":true,"fontSize":13,"color":"#111827"},{"content":"要点：车里唯一的通讯工具，打电话/发起视频通话走它。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"讲解①：用户语音\"给张三打视频电话\"→ Director 调本工具。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"讲解②：资料仅见工具表一行，无端云分工、无车型 PRD。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"【已落地-待核】","fontSize":10,"color":"#6B7280"}],"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"rect","id":"N13-02","x":400,"y":80,"width":300,"height":150,"fillColor":"#D1FAE5","borderColor":"#059669","borderWidth":2,"borderRadius":8,"text":[{"content":"N13-02 案例：副驾在停车场打视频\n","bold":true,"fontSize":13,"color":"#111827"},{"content":"要点：游泳馆停车场，副驾想给朋友看泳池。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"讲解①：走 N13-01，主链照常（见 N14 计时）。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"讲解②：与后台视觉链路无关，不额外占主链耗时。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"【讲解例】","fontSize":10,"color":"#6B7280"}],"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"rect","id":"N13-03","x":760,"y":80,"width":300,"height":150,"fillColor":"#D1FAE5","borderColor":"#059669","borderWidth":2,"borderRadius":8,"text":[{"content":"N13-03 通话结果卡片 → N20 任务中心\n","bold":true,"fontSize":13,"color":"#111827"},{"content":"要点：通话状态/未接提醒走卡片展示。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"讲解①：卡片在任务中心生命周期内（见 12 节 T 图）。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"讲解②：不播 TTS、不打断主驾导航。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"【待核】","fontSize":10,"color":"#6B7280"}],"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"rect","id":"N13-04","x":40,"y":290,"width":560,"height":160,"fillColor":"#F5F5F4","borderColor":"#78716C","borderWidth":2,"borderRadius":8,"text":[{"content":"N13-04 后台逐帧\"Special Token\"链路（与用户打不打电话无关）\n","bold":true,"fontSize":13,"color":"#111827"},{"content":"要点：云端视觉触发器 PRD 提到——持续视觉任务复用\"豆包视频通话\"的 Special Token，逐图预测。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"讲解①：Special Token = 逐帧推理时标识\"这是一帧视频\"的特殊标记，后台常驻。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"讲解②：开始=视觉持续任务下发；结束=任务取消或离车；上报=逐图结果给触发器规则判断。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"讲解③：车端算力大户，不占主链；端云分工、车型、耗时均未写。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"【待核】","fontSize":10,"color":"#6B7280"}],"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"rect","id":"N13-05","x":640,"y":290,"width":420,"height":160,"fillColor":"#F5F5F4","borderColor":"#78716C","borderWidth":2,"borderRadius":8,"text":[{"content":"N13-05 与 N2 Watcher 的边界\n","bold":true,"fontSize":13,"color":"#111827"},{"content":"要点：Watcher 全时多模聆听（N2）是\"永远在线\"；\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"本层逐帧链路是\"按需下发的视觉持续任务\"。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"Watcher 触发→可能唤起本链路；本链路不反向触发通话。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"【待核】","fontSize":10,"color":"#6B7280"}],"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"rect","id":"N13-06","x":40,"y":500,"width":1020,"height":120,"fillColor":"#F5F5F4","borderColor":"#78716C","borderWidth":2,"borderRadius":8,"text":[{"content":"N13-06 待核清单（不许编造）\n","bold":true,"fontSize":13,"color":"#111827"},{"content":"① 无独立\"车载视频通话\"PRD；drive 检索\"豆包视频通话 车/车载 视频通话\"无结果。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"② vehicle_communication 的输入输出、失败回执、端云分工未在工具明细中展开。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"③ \"豆包视频通话\"逐帧 Special Token 仅一句来源，需向视觉触发器 owner 要原文。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"④ 车型：上汽/赛力斯/路特斯均未提及；手车互联六项（N12）不含视频通话。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"【待核】","fontSize":10,"color":"#6B7280"}],"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"rect","id":"N13-07","x":40,"y":660,"width":1020,"height":90,"fillColor":"#F5F5F4","borderColor":"#78716C","borderWidth":2,"borderRadius":8,"text":[{"content":"图例\n","bold":true,"fontSize":13,"color":"#111827"},{"content":"蓝底=工具入口｜绿底=结果回流/案例｜灰底=待核或职责引用（灰虚线连线=跨模块引用）\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"},{"content":"状态角标：【已落地-待核】工具存在但细节未展开；【待核】仅有间接来源；本篇不写成现网事实。\n","fontSize":11,"color":"#374151"}],"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top"},{"type":"connector","connector":{"from":"N13-01","to":"N13-02","fromAnchor":"bottom","toAnchor":"top","lineShape":"rightAngle","lineColor":"#2563eb","lineWidth":2,"lineStyle":"solid","startArrow":"none","endArrow":"arrow","label":""}},{"type":"connector","connector":{"from":"N13-02","to":"N13-03","fromAnchor":"bottom","toAnchor":"top","lineShape":"rightAngle","lineColor":"#2563eb","lineWidth":2,"lineStyle":"solid","startArrow":"none","endArrow":"arrow","label":""}},{"type":"connector","connector":{"from":"N13-05","to":"N13-04","fromAnchor":"left","toAnchor":"right","lineShape":"rightAngle","lineColor":"#78716C","lineWidth":2,"lineStyle":"dashed","endArrow":"arrow","label":"Watcher 可唤起"}}]}